  "goodToKnow": "Minder is a formal word for less or lesser: nicht minder (no less), mehr oder minder (more or less), von minderer Qualität (of inferior quality). It lives on in many compounds: minderjährig (underage), die Minderheit (minority), minderwertig (inferior), der Minderwertigkeitskomplex (inferiority complex). The verb mindern means to reduce: die Miete mindern (to reduce the rent because of defects), a tenant's right in Germany."
